{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consciousness returns slowly. Your head pounds as fragmented memories refuse to surface. All you know is that you're alone, inside the sewer system and you've got to get out with any means necessary. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Far a Night</strong> is an action horror first-person shooter that challenges the player to survive the dangers of an indoor environment of a series of levels that is packed with traps, uncanny rooms, inconceivable horrors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the world of Far a Night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dangerous place unravels as you wander around searching to find answers.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149560/extras/4c5486864e8e3925c643d30de62271d3.avif?t=1771007623\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect evidence</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather scattered clues and piece together the truth behind this mystery as you uncover what happened in these depths and why you're trapped here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149560/extras/857af46a6cdb7c85f21717bc79633ea3.avif?t=1771007623\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve your way through</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the weapons that you have in your disposal and solve your way through each room and puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149560/extras/bc8f2d166b72d99c341960cdb95d0f95.avif?t=1771007623\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Avoid traps and dangers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alert to deadly mechanisms, environmental hazards, and the unspeakable horrors that hunt you through this hostile indoor complex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149560/extras/56e3bba98db781628e4304d2e4c65a61.avif?t=1771007623\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4149560?t=1771007623","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149560/727395f25077b24c4dd0310f546821eb877ab41c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771007623","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149560/273a55881837eab23fd2550ecf91d2f2e1f6425f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771007623","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149560/273a55881837eab23fd2550ecf91d2f2e1f6425f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771007623","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Contains graphic horror imagery and depictions of blood and gore, including dismembered skeletal remains and blood-filled environments. Features disturbing scenes intended for mature audiences. No sexual content is depicted."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consciousness returns slowly. Your head pounds as fragmented memories refuse to surface. All you know is that you're alone, inside the sewer system and you've got to get out with any means necessary. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Far a Night</strong> is an action horror first-person shooter that challenges the player to survive the dangers of an indoor environment of a series of levels that is packed with traps, uncanny rooms, inconceivable horrors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the world of Far a Night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dangerous 